WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.800 line:92% size:92%
Three products, five allies for your crop.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:12.536 line:92% size:92%
NANO-STEEL controls nematodes. NANO-XTINGER, fungi that damage the root. And NANO-MIX, insect pests.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.293 line:92% size:92%
Their spores travel protected in a water-soluble gel.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.100 line:92% size:92%
On contact with water, the gel dissolves and the spores spread through the soil.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.778 line:92% size:92%
Water early or at dusk, out of direct sun, so the spores arrive alive.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.045 line:92% size:92%
At the root they live in symbiosis with the plant: they strengthen it and help it grow.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.700 line:92% size:92%
And they improve soil life: more microfauna, more balance.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.508 line:92% size:92%
Together they complement each other: they protect the soil, the root and the plant, preventively and curatively.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.815 line:92% size:92%
Demeter. Certified organic biocontrol.
